e/iterate-dashboard.html", "turns": 27, "seconds": 381}}], "iterate": "Take your time and iterate: render the page in a headless browser (python3 has Playwright and Chromium installed), look at the screenshots at desktop and mobile widths, and keep improving the design until it is excellent, distinctive and not generic."}, "linear": {"typeScale": null, "colors": null, "buttons": null, "fonts": null}}